        <h1>IEEE Humanitarian Activities Committee <span style="color: var(--ieee-blue)">(HAC)</span></h1>
        <p>The IEEE Humanitarian Activities Committee (HAC) provides a suite of resources that inspire and enable IEEE volunteers around the world to carry out and support impactful humanitarian technology and sustainable development activities at the local level. HAC focuses on raising awareness, providing training, supporting and evaluating projects, and cultivating relationships within the global sustainable development community.</p>
